{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123342","id":4487021099,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC3KCKw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123342","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123342.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123342.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123342","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123342/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123342/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123342/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c6eefc27bfb5e57c6808048971a9686d315d164","number":123342,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Editor: Show project settings references in dependency owners dialog","user":{"login":"salwa-gitt","id":229059879,"node_id":"U_kgDODactJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229059879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt","html_url":"https://github.com/salwa-gitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #108186\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nWhen a custom GUI theme resource (or other project settings resource like the main scene) is set inside **Project Settings**, right-clicking the resource in the FileSystem dock and selecting **View Owners...** previously reported \"No owners found\".\r\n\r\nThis PR updates `DependencyEditorOwners::show()` in `editor/file_system/dependency_editor.cpp` to explicitly check project settings references. It normalizes paths using `ResourceUID::ensure_path()` so that resource comparisons succeed even when project settings store references in UID format (`uid://...`).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### Contribution & AI Usage Disclosure\r\nI am a beginner developer making my contributions to the Godot Engine to learn codebase architecture and Git workflows. \r\n\r\nFor transparency, AI assistance was used during the debugging and implementation process:\r\n* **Google Gemini:** Helped analyze terminal outputs, explain Godot engine architecture concepts, and guide step-by-step Git commands and debugger setup.\r\n* **GitHub Copilot (VS Code):** Used to inspect path comparisons and suggest applying `ResourceUID::ensure_path(...)` to handle `uid://` string resolution.\r\n\r\nMy role was driving the problem-solving process, setting up the test environment in the editor, configuring breakpoints and running the debugger in VS Code, testing builds locally with SCons, and verifying the UI fix.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.githu